          "text": "Bombay Brassiere located at Indiranagar, Bengaluru is part of the famous and popular chain of restaurants in India. They are well known for their variety of North Indian cuisine. We went there as a family reunion and enjoyed our evening. We relished Glenfidich whisky, Red Sangria and mocktails for drinks with Paneer Tikka, Sweet Potato masala and Crispy Corn for Starters. We ordered Tandoori Roti,",
